  "ruleText": "We 901.01 Administrative Fine Amount. Except as provided by We 901.02 administrative fines shall be assessed in accordance with Env-C 610 or Env-C 616, or successor rules.\n\nSource. #4549, eff 1-1-89; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96\n\nNew. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96\n\nNew. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
